    "id": 109,
    "normalized_key": "gehealthcare:operationalmanagementleadershipprogramintern:bangalore",
    "title": "Operational Management Leadership Program Intern",
    "company": "GE HealthCare",
    "location_raw": "Bengaluru",
    "city": "Bangalore",
    "job_type": "internship",
    "posted_date": "2026-11-17T23:59:59+00:00",
    "apply_url": "https://gehc.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/GEHC_ExternalSite/job/Bengaluru/Operational-Management-Leadership-Program-Intern_R4049562-1",
    "description": "Job Description Summary\nThe Operations management development program will provide you an opportunity to work in various departments within our organization such as production, supply chain, quality control, engineering etc. You will be exposed to different aspects of operations like planning, execution, quality assurance, maintenance, safety & health, training and development. This program will give you a good understanding of how to manage people and processes effectively.\nGE HealthCare is a leading global medical technology and digital solutions innovator. Our purpose is to create a world where healthcare has no limits. Unlock your ambition, turn ideas into world-changing realities, and join an organization where every voice makes a difference, and every difference builds a healthier world. tex\nJob Description\nPlease note that this position is being advertised to encourage applications from individuals identified through our partner colleges during this year\u2019s recruiting activities.\nRoles & Responsibilities:\n\u2022 Manage day-to-day activities of assigned department/section including supervision of staff, scheduling of tasks, assigning of resources, monitoring progress against targets, resolving issues/problems arising out of operational challenges, ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements, maintaining records/reports related to operations, managing inventory levels etc.\n\u2022 Develop strategies for improving productivity by identifying areas where efficiency can be improved or costs reduced without compromising on quality standards.\n\u2022 Ensure timely completion of all projects undertaken by the department/section under your purview.\n\u2022 Provide guidance and support to subordinates regarding their career growth opportunities within the organization.\n\u2022 Maintain proper documentation related to all aspects of operations including but not limited to production records, financial reports, employee records, training materials, safety protocols etc.\n\u2022 Monitor performance metrics regularly to assess effectiveness of implemented measures and take corrective action wherever necessary.\n\u2022 Collaborate with other departments/sections to achieve organizational goals.\n\u2022 Identify potential risks associated with operations and implement appropriate mitigation measures accordingly.\n\u2022 Implement lean manufacturing techniques to streamline processes and eliminate waste.\n\u2022 Promote a culture of continuous improvement within the department/section under your supervision.\nQualification Required:\n\u2022 Bachelor\u2019s degree in Engineering (Mechanical / Production) or equivalent from recognized university\n\u2022 Strong analytical skills with ability to interpret data and draw meaningful conclusions\n\u2022 Knowledge of MS Office suite including Excel, PowerPoint, Word, Outlook etc\nDesired Characteristics\n\u2022 Strong oral and written communication skills.\n\u2022 Strong interpersonal and leadership skills.\n\u2022 Ability to influence others and lead small teams.\n\u2022 Ability to coordinate several projects simultaneously.\nInclusion and Diversity\nGE Healthcare is an Equal Opportunity Employer where inclusion matters. Employment decisions are made without regard to race, color, religion, national or ethnic origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, disability, protected veteran status or other characteristics protected by law.\nWe expect all employees to live and breathe our behaviors: to act with humility and build trust; lead with transparency; deliver with focus, and drive ownership \u2013 always with unyielding integrity.\nOur total rewards are designed to unlock your ambition by giving you the boost and flexibility you need to turn your ideas into world-changing realities. Our salary and benefits are everything you\u2019d expect from an organization with global strength and scale, and you\u2019ll be surrounded by career opportunities in a culture that fosters care, collaboration and support.",
