    "description": "Sigmoid Analytics is a fast-growing data and analytics company that partners with global enterprises to deliver real-time business insights. As part of the expansion of our Finance & Accounting team, we are looking for Semi-Qualified Chartered Accountants (CA Inter cleared) who are eager to gain hands-on experience in core finance functions.\nLocation\nSigmoid Analytics\n2nd Floor, Tower-2, SJR I PARK\nRoad Number 9, EPIP Zone, Whitefield\nBengaluru, Karnataka \u2013 560066\nDuration\n\u2022 6-month engagement\n\u2022 Opportunity for conversion to a full-time role based on performance\nEligibility Criteria\nWho Can Apply?\n\u2022 Semi-Qualified CA ( CA Inter cleared \u2013 one or both groups)\n\u2022 Currently pursuing CA internship or articleship\n\u2022 Aspiring to complete CA qualification in the future\nRoles & Responsibilities\n\u2022 Handle day-to-day accounting and bookkeeping activities\n\u2022 Assist with month-end closing processes and financial reporting\n\u2022 Prepare and file GST returns\n\u2022 Calculate and deduct TDS as per applicable regulations\n\u2022 Prepare and file TDS returns\n\u2022 Support statutory, internal, and tax audits\n\u2022 Perform ledger reconciliations and account reviews\n\u2022 Ensure compliance with accounting standards and taxation regulations\nRequired Skills & Qualifications\nEducational Qualification\n\u2022 Semi-Qualified Chartered Accountant (CA Inter)\nTechnical Skills\n\u2022 Experience or exposure to audit, core accounting, compliance, and taxation\n\u2022 Working knowledge of GST, TDS, payroll processing, and statutory filings\n\u2022 Proficiency in:\n\u2022 MS Excel\n\u2022 MS Word\n\u2022 Microsoft PowerPoint\n\u2022 Familiarity with accounting software such as:\n\u2022 Tally\n\u2022 SAP\n\u2022 Zoho Books\n\u2022 QuickBooks\nSoft Skills\n\u2022 Strong analytical and problem-solving abilities\n\u2022 Good written and verbal communication skills\n\u2022 High attention to detail and accuracy\n\u2022 Responsible, proactive, and professional attitude\nWhy Join Sigmoid?\n\u2022 Work with a dynamic and fast-paced finance team\n\u2022 Gain practical corporate experience in accounting, taxation, and compliance\n\u2022 Learn from experienced finance professionals and industry experts\n\u2022 Potential opportunity for a full-time role based on performance\n\u2022 Exposure to a technology-driven and high-growth organization\nNote:\nBy submitting your application, you consent to being contacted by our Talent Acquisition team via phone call, email, SMS, WhatsApp, or other communication channels regarding your application and relevant career opportunities.",
