    "description": "## What you\u2019ll do:\nThe End User Compute Operations role is responsible for monitoring, triaging, assigning, and resolving end-user computing incidents across virtual desktop environments. This role serves as a key operational resource for maintaining stability, improving user experience, and driving continuous service improvements within Azure Virtual Desktop (AVDI), Citrix, and Windows 365 environments. The engineer will actively manage incident queues, coordinate communications during critical outages, and identify opportunities to improve first-level support resolution rates.\nKey Responsibilities\nIncident Management & Queue Oversight\n\u2022 Monitor and manage the incident ticket queue to ensure timely assignment and resolution of support requests.\n\u2022 Review all incoming incidents and assign unassigned tickets to the appropriate support resources.\n\u2022 Perform initial triage of tickets to determine severity, impact, and resolution path.\n\u2022 Resolve low-effort incidents during ticket review, including common issues such as VDI restarts, session resets, and basic connectivity issues.\n\u2022 Identify tickets that can be quickly resolved and communicate prioritization recommendations to assigned engineers to improve user experience and reduce resolution times.\nTechnical Support & Resolution\n\u2022 Investigate, troubleshoot, and resolve incidents related to:\no Azure Virtual Desktop (AVDI)\no Citrix Virtual Apps and Desktops\no Windows 365 Cloud PC\no Virtual desktop performance and connectivity\no User access and authentication issues\no Profile, application, and session management\n\u2022 Document troubleshooting activities and maintain accurate incident records.\n\u2022 Escalate complex issues appropriately while maintaining ownership through resolution.\n## Qualifications:\n## Skills:\nKey Competencies\n\u2022 Incident Management\n\u2022 Service Desk Operations\n\u2022 Virtual Desktop Infrastructure (VDI)\n\u2022 Azure Virtual Desktop (AVD)\n\u2022 Citrix Administration\n\u2022 Windows 365\n\u2022 Problem Management\n\u2022 Major Incident Communications\n\u2022 Operational Excellence\n\u2022 Customer Experience Focus\n\u2022 Process Improvement\n\u2022 Technical Troubleshooting",
