    "posted_date": "2026-11-10T23:59:59+00:00",
    "apply_url": "https://db.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com/DBWebsite/job/Jaipur/Clearing-and-Settlement-Analyst--AS_R0450725",
    "description": "Job Description:\nJob Title: Clearing and Settlement Analyst, AS\nLocation: Jaipur, India\nRole Description\n\u2022 An Associate is responsible for the effective day to day management of the production and process of Trade Services Business.\n\u2022 Incumbent can be placed in any of the Trade Services Process and should possess complete knowledge of their core and cross trained process which can be Settlement-Matching/Fails/Instructions/Registered Shares/Confirmation, Cancellations, Reconciliation, Transaction Reporting or Trade Investigation.\n\u2022 You are responsible for ensuring that functions are fulfilled to agreed standards and timescales using appropriate tools and techniques. It includes facilitating efficient and effective MIS Reporting and Exception Handling.\n\u2022 This role is focused on providing support to the Manager and will act as a point of reference for team members, management and other concerned parties.\n\u2022 The role involves a strong element of team support, interpersonal, management and customer relations\u2019 skills. Excellent personal organisation and prioritisation skills are required with the ability to adapt to changing demands and priorities.\nWhat we\u2019ll offer you\nAs part of our flexible scheme, here are just some of the benefits that you\u2019ll enjoy\n\u2022 Best in class leave policy\n\u2022 Gender neutral parental leaves\n\u2022 100% reimbursement under childcare assistance benefit (gender neutral)\n\u2022 Sponsorship for Industry relevant certifications and education\n\u2022 Employee Assistance Program for you and your family members\n\u2022 Comprehensive Hospitalization Insurance for you and your dependents\n\u2022 Accident and Term life Insurance\n\u2022 Complementary Health screening for 35 yrs. and above\nYour key responsibilities\nThe job holder is responsible for\n\u2022 Domain knowledge of the processes. Should be completely involved in daily production.\n\u2022 Reporting to the client and the management\n\u2022 Timely escalations of exceptional issues to internal management\n\u2022 Ensuring that service levels are met and strive to exceed service levels\n\u2022 Coordinating with the training team and Senior team members to ensure that all documentation, processes and procedures are accurate and up to date and ensure that all staff are aware of these and follow them\n\u2022 Planning and managing training and ensure staff are adequately trained\n\u2022 Ensuring ongoing coaching of team members and ensure personal development plans are in place for all team leaders and members\n\u2022 Ensuring productivity processes are robust and strive to improve productivity\n\u2022 Managing the quality control process within the team, ensure adherence to quality concepts and drive a process of continuous improvement in quality\n\u2022 Monitoring, measuring and reporting on operational issues, opportunities and development plans and achievements within agreed formats and timescales\n\u2022 Promoting awareness of the Escalation Matrix within the team and ensure adherence of the same\n\u2022 Owning the allocation and prioritization of all work. Review and reallocate work as necessary.\nThe jobholder will strive to deliver on these responsibilities\n\u2022 Through an active demonstration of the company values in behaviour and attitude\n\u2022 By building supportive relationships with his peers and colleagues\n\u2022 By continually up-grading domain knowledge\n\u2022 By understanding the business of the company and the related market dynamics\n\u2022 By exhibiting discipline on a personal level as well as a professional level\n\u2022 By actively managing related risks and anticipating change\n\u2022 By demonstrating pride in the company brand\nYour skills and experience\nQualifications (describe the qualifications considered essential to do the job, e.g., Chartered Accountancy, MBA, etc)\n\u2022 Graduate / Postgraduate\nSkills & Work Experience\n(describe the skills and experience considered essential to do the job)\n\u2022 Good communication skills (English and German language specialist)\n\u2022 Computer literate\n\u2022 Ability to prioritize work\n\u2022 Proactive team player\n\u2022 Problem solving capabilities\n\u2022 Eye for detail\n\u2022 High interpersonal skills\n\u2022 Service excellence oriented\n\u2022 People Management\n\u2022 Minimum B1 Level German proficiency Required\nKey Performance Indicators:\n\u2022 Ensuring that the performance indicators as mentioned in the service level agreement for all the processes are met.\n\u2022 Meet and exceed timelines targets on a consistent basis.\n\u2022 Meet and exceed quality targets on a consistent basis\n\u2022 To ensure that the queries are raised within the stipulated TAT\n\u2022 Create and maintain MIS sheet\n\u2022 To provide process improvement suggestion\n\u2022 To conduct quality checks\nProven ability to leverage AI tools to enhance productivity, optimise workflows to solve business problems, while applying critical judgment to ensure responsible and ethical use of data and AI outputs.\nHow we\u2019ll support you\n\u2022 Training and development to help you excel in your career\n\u2022 Coaching and support from experts in your team\n\u2022 A culture of continuous learning to aid progression\n\u2022 A range of flexible benefits that you can tailor to suit your needs\nAbout us and our teams\nPlease visit our company website for further information:\nhttps://www.db.com/company/company.html\nWe strive for a culture in which we are empowered to excel together every day. This includes acting responsibly, thinking commercially, taking initiative and working collaboratively.\nTogether we share and celebrate the successes of our people. Together we are Deutsche Bank Group.\nWe welcome applications from all people and promote a positive, fair and inclusive work environment.",
