    "apply_url": "https://motorolasolutions.wd5.myworkdayjobs.com/Careers/job/Bangalore-India/Finance-Intern_R69750",
    "description": "Company Overview\nAt Motorola Solutions, we believe that everything starts with our people. We\u2019re a global close-knit community, united by the relentless pursuit to help keep people safer everywhere. We build and connect technologies to help protect people, property and places. Our solutions foster the collaboration that\u2019s critical for safer communities, safer schools, safer hospitals, safer businesses, and ultimately, safer nations. Connect with a career that matters, and help us build a safer future.\nDepartment Overview\nDevelopment Services\nJob Description\nTo support statutory audit and monthly closing activities\nTo support various compliance activity process\nTo support preparations of financial statement and financial reports\nTo support financial statement analysis\nTo support various forecast process\nTo support various process improvement projects\nTo support ad-hoc requests\nBasic Requirements\nIndustrial Trainee- IPCC both groups cleared\nMBA\nAccounting and Compliance\nTravel Requirements\nNone\nRelocation Provided\nNone\nPosition Type\nIntern\nReferral Payment Plan\nNo\nEEO Statement\nMotorola Solutions is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion or belief, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, veteran status or any other legally-protected characteristic.\nWe are proud of our people-first and community-focused culture, empowering every Motorolan to be their most authentic self and to do their best work to deliver on the promise of a safer world. If you\u2019d like to join our team but feel that you don\u2019t quite meet all of the preferred skills, we\u2019d still love to hear why you think you\u2019d be a great addition to our team.",
