    "description": "About Sarvam\nSarvam is building the bedrock of Sovereign AI for India, a full-stack sovereign AI platform spanning research, models, infrastructure, and applications, with a singular focus on making AI genuinely work for India. Sarvam works with leading enterprises and public institutions and is backed by Lightspeed, Peak XV, and Khosla Ventures. We partner with India's leading brands, including Tata Capital, SBI Life, CRED, IDFC, and LIC.\nAbout the Role\nWe are looking for a sharp, high-ownership Marketing Intern to act as the primary story-builder and content engine across Sarvam\u2019s marketing channels.\nThis is not a passive internship focused on surface-level social updates. You will translate complex frontier AI capabilities like our Vision APIs, Document Intelligence models, and voice platforms into crisp, high-impact stories, viral launch threads, and sharp enterprise collateral. You will sit at the intersection of product, creative execution, and creator operations, helping shape how Sarvam communicates its sovereign AI vision to technical builders, enterprise buyers, and the broader ecosystem.\nWhat You'll Do\nCustomer Stories & Launch Comms\n\u2022 Transform technical milestones into narratives: Turn enterprise customer deployments into compelling case studies and written success stories.\n\u2022 Drive product launch comms: Draft multi-channel launch content\u2014from sharp X/LinkedIn feature threads to enterprise mailers for prospects and existing clients.\n\u2022 Simplify the complex: Translate technical AI concepts into clear, punchy prose without losing accuracy or depth.\nSocial Content & Video Operations\n\u2022 Drive video execution: Write scripts for explainer videos and product walkthroughs; coordinate shoots and post-production workflows.\n\u2022 Manage multi-platform publishing: Oversee daily social presence across X, LinkedIn, Instagram, and YouTube, ensuring high content velocity and visual quality.\nCreator & Influencer Operations\n\u2022 Manage creator partnerships: Source, pitch, and recruit relevant tech creators, developer voices, and industry influencers.\n\u2022 Execute campaign logistics: Draft campaign briefs, align timelines, and track deliverables from initial outreach to final publish.\nWhat We're Looking For\n\u2022 Editorial precision: Exceptional written English skills with an instinct for tone, structure, and clarity across social, email, and long-form formats.\n\u2022 Technical translation capability: Comfortable diving into technical platforms, developer dashboards, or AI research to write simple, accurate marketing copy.\n\u2022 AI-first workflow: Habitual use of AI tools for rapid research, content structuring, and drafting.\n\u2022 Platform fluency: Deep, native understanding of content formats, algorithms, and tone across X, LinkedIn, Instagram, and YouTube.\n\u2022 Execution & ownership: Uncompromising attention to detail, strong organizational discipline, and the ability to drive multiple deadlines without hand-holding.\nBonus Points\n\u2022 Hands-on experience with video editing tools or ba",
