    "normalized_key": "paytm:talentacquisitioninternitrecruitment:noida",
    "title": "Talent Acquisition Intern - IT Recruitment",
    "company": "Paytm",
    "location_raw": "Noida, Uttar Pradesh",
    "city": "Noida",
    "job_type": "internship",
    "posted_date": "2026-10-20T06:18:18.447000",
    "apply_url": "https://jobs.lever.co/paytm/95eadc2b-27bf-40fe-b6e6-93aaeadd08f7",
    "description": "\u00a0\nTalent Acquisition Intern - Noida\nNoida, Uttar Pradesh\nHR \u2013 Recruitment /\nIntern /\nOn-site\n\u00a0\nLocation: Noida\nDuration: 6 months\nWorking days: 5 days work from office\n\u00a0\nAbout Paytm Group: Paytm is India's leading mobile payments and financial services distribution company. Pioneer of the mobile QR payments revolution in India, Paytm builds technologies that help small businesses with payments and commerce. Paytm's mission is to serve half a billion Indians and bring them to the mainstream economy with the help of technology.\n\u00a0\nAbout the role: A Talent Acquisition (TA) Intern will support the recruitment team in sourcing and screening candidates for technology roles. The role will involve working on real-time tech hiring requirements, coordinating interviews, candidate communication, maintaining recruitment trackers, and supporting hiring drives.\n\u00a0\nKey Responsibilities:\n\u00a0\n* Source and screen candidates for Tech roles through LinkedIn, Naukri and other platforms.\n* Identify relevant profiles based on technical requirements and job descriptions.\n* Conduct initial candidate communication and HR screening calls.\n* Coordinate interviews between candidates, recruiters and hiring managers.\n* Support tech hiring drives, including weekend drives, as required.\n* Maintain recruitment trackers, candidate databases and hiring reports.\n* Support job postings, offer documentation and candidate follow-ups.\n* Work closely with recruiters and stakeholders to ensure smooth hiring.\n* Assist with employer branding and other TA initiatives.\n\u00a0\nSkills & Qualifications:\n* Strong communication and interpersonal skills.\n* Basic understanding of Talent Acquisition and recruitment processes.\n* Good sourcing and candidate screening skills.\n* Ability to understand basic technical job requirements.\n* Good coordination and stakeholder management skills.\n* Proficiency in MS Excel / Google Sheets.\n* Strong organizational skills and attention to detail.\n* Knowledge of LinkedIn, Naukri and other sourcing platforms will be an advantage.\n* Proactive attitude, willingness to learn and ability to work in a fast-paced environment.\n\u00a0\nWhat You Will Gain\nHands-on exposure to Tech Talent Acquisition and recruitment operations.\nExperience working on real-time technology hiring requirements.\nExposure to sourcing, screening, HR calls and interview coordination.\nExperience handling tech hiring drives and recruitment reporting.\nOpportunity to interact with candidates, recruiters and business stakeholders.\nPractical understanding of the end-to-end recruitment process.\nWe may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support parts of the hiring process, such as reviewing applications, analyzing resumes, or assessing responses and identifying potential inconsistencies or verification signals in application materials based on available information. These tools assist our recruitment team but do not replace human judgment. Final hiring decisions are ultimately made by humans. If you would like more information about how your data is processed, please contact us.\n\u00a0\n\u00a0\n",
