    "description": "Job Location\nMUMBAI GENERAL OFFICE\nJob Description\nProcter & Gamble is dedicated to providing valuable hands-on experience to interns and co-op students. This non-management role is an excellent opportunity for growth and learning within the company.\nJob Description\nThis Intern/Co-op role is designed to provide students with a well-rounded work experience. Interns will have the opportunity to work on a variety of tasks, gain practical skills, and contribute to team projects.\nKey Responsibilities\n\u2022\n\u2022 Participate in team projects and contribute to achieving team goals.\n\u2022 Perform tasks as assigned, ensuring quality and timeliness.\n\u2022 Learn and apply new concepts, tools, and techniques as part of the internship/co-op experience.\n\u2022 Cultivate strong collaborative relationships within the team.\n\u2022 Engage in learning opportunities for personal growth and development.\n\u2022\n\u2022\nQualifications\n\u2022\n\u2022 Current enrollment in a relevant degree program.\n\u2022 Eagerness to learn and grow professionally.\n\u2022 Ability to work collaboratively in a team environment.\n\u2022 Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.\n\u2022 Excellent communication skills, both written and verbal.\n\u2022\n\u2022\nJob Qualifications\nMBA\nJob Schedule\nFull time\nJob Number\nR000160037\nJob Segmentation\nInternships",
