    "description": "Role: Field Facilitator\n\u00a0\nProject: Financial Literacy Training project by Paytm Foundation\n\u00a0\nLocation: Noida, Uttar Pradesh\n\u00a0\nProject Duration: 6 Months\n\u00a0\nField Facilitator \u2013 Key Responsibilities\n1. School &amp; Stakeholder Coordination\n\u25cf Coordinate with schools and local stakeholders for permissions and scheduling of\ntraining sessions.\n\u25cf Maintain regular communication with school authorities for smooth implementation.\n2. Student Mobilisation &amp; Training\n\u25cf Mobilise students and school staff for participation in the sessions.\n\u25cf Conduct Digital &amp; Financial Literacy sessions through videos, discussions,\ndemonstrations, and interactive activities.\n3. Assessment &amp; Monitoring\n\u25cf Conduct baseline and endline assessments to measure learning and awareness.\n\u25cf Monitor attendance, participation, and engagement during sessions.\n\u25cf Support field monitoring visits and ensure quality implementation.\n4. Documentation &amp; Reporting\n\u25cf Maintain attendance records, beneficiary data, and session-wise documentation.\n\u25cf Collect participant feedback, testimonials, and success stories.\n\u25cf Capture photographs and videos of training sessions.\n5. Project Support\n\u25cf Ensure timely completion of scheduled training sessions and project activities.\n\u25cf Coordinate distribution of IEC materials, handouts, and certificates.\n\u25cf Document key observations, challenges, and learnings from the field.\nPreferred Skills &amp; Experience\n\u25cf Graduate/Postgraduate in Social Work, Development Studies, Rural Development,\nManagement, or a related field.\n\u25cf Prior experience in education, community outreach, or field projects preferred.\n\u25cf Good communication and interpersonal skills, with the ability to engage effectively with\nstudents and school staff.\n\u00a0\n\u25cf Comfortable conducting interactive training sessions and facilitating group discussions.\n\u25cf Basic skills in data collection, documentation, and report preparation.\n\u25cf Willingness to undertake regular field visits and coordinate with schools and local\nstakeholders.\n",
