    "description": "About Us: \n\nPaytm is India's leading mobile payments and financial services distribution company. Pioneer of the  mobile QR payments revolution in India, Paytm builds technologies that help small businesses with  payments and commerce. Paytm\u2019s mission is to serve half a billion Indians and bring them to the  mainstream economy with the help of technology. \n\nAbout the Role:\n Job Description We are looking for energetic and self-driven professionals to join our Offline User Growth Team. The  role involves identifying growth opportunities across the city, building relationships with merchants,  businesses, institutions and communities, and driving on-ground user acquisition initiatives. \n\nKey Responsibilities:\n \uf0b7 Visit markets, shops, restaurants, caf\u00e9s, retail outlets and other high-footfall locations to  identify growth opportunities. \n\uf0b7 Build and manage partnerships with regional/local brands and businesses. \n\uf0b7 Identify and develop corporate, college, institutional and community partnerships. \n\uf0b7 Engage with merchants, customers and local communities to understand market needs  and provide relevant feedback. \n\uf0b7 Identify new opportunities for user acquisition, brand visibility and local marketing  initiatives. \n\uf0b7 Support execution of merchant programmes, college activities, community initiatives and  other local campaigns. \n\uf0b7 Work closely with internal teams to take identified opportunities from initiation to  closure. \n\uf0b7 Maintain regular tracking of visits, opportunities, partnerships and execution. \n\nWhat We\u2019re Looking For:\n \uf0b7 Good knowledge of the local market/city. \n\uf0b7 Strong communication and relationship-building skills.\n \uf0b7 Comfortable with extensive field work and meeting different stakeholders.\n \uf0b7 Ability to independently identify opportunities and follow up consistently. \n\uf0b7 Good command of the local language. \n\uf0b7 Candidates with experience in field sales, business development, partnerships, merchant  acquisition, market development or similar roles would be relevant.\n",
