    "apply_url": "https://jobs.lever.co/weloglobal/66de9c16-fbd8-4235-b8be-a4e84cb7486d",
    "description": "Welo Data is looking for someone with a genuine passion for music and the artists behind it, across genres. This is an entry level role suited to a candidate with strong research skills, sharp attention to detail, and the ability to stay focused through long stretches of repetitive work.\n\u00a0\nRole Overview-\nYou'll contribute to content delivered across produces from a leading consumer technology company, released to markets across the globe. The core of the work is quality control, QCing and syncing lyrics as well as editing and QCing metadata, to meet style guide and quality requirements before content reaches the audience. You'll collaborate with local and international teams to monitor and improve product quality, using your market expertise to enhance the user experience for your region. This role reports into the Project Management layer, working alongside multiple PMs on the project.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nProject Details-\n\u00a0\nMusic language- Hindi & Punjabi\nType of Employment: Contract\nProject Duration: 12 Months of Contract with possible extension\u00a0\nWorking Hours / Schedule: 12:30pm - 9:30pm IST (Indian Standard Time), 1h unpaid lunch break, Monday to Friday (40 hours/week).\u00a0\nLocation: Remote in the India\nPay rate: 650,000.00 INR/year\u00a0\n\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\u2022 QC and sync lyrical content in Hindi & Punjabi - Edit and QC metadata to meet style guide requirements\n\u2022 Ensure content meets style guide and quality requirements before it reaches the audience.\n\u2022 Evaluate internal and external content against quality standards\n\u2022 Spot issues and inconsistencies within large volumes of content and make sound judgement calls within established guidelines.\n\u2022 Work collaboratively with local and international teams\n\u2022 Help identify recurring errors and support process improvements\n\u2022 Adapt as products and priorities evolve\n\u2022 Ability to follow detailed style guides and documented processes consistently\n\nRequirements:\n\u2022 Experience within tech, product, digital media or entertainment\n\u2022 Experience handling metadata\n\u2022 Experience moderating language content in the target language.\n\u2022 Self-motivated, with the ability to handle repetitive tasks\n\u2022 Highly detail-oriented, with the ability to multi-task, prioritise and meet deadlines in a fast-paced environment\n\u2022 Strong problem-solving and analytical skills\n\u2022 Broad knowledge of and passion for music, musicians and genres across the board Strong written and verbal communication skills.\n\u2022 Full professional proficiency in English, both written and spoken, plus native level fluency in the Punjabi language\n\u2022 Flexibility to support additional projects aligned with business needs, as required.\n\u2022 Preferred proficiency on Mac OS systems\n\nIf this sounds like an opportunity you\u2019d like to jump at, please send us your application.\n\u00a0\nJob reference: #L1-CC1\n",
